  "problem": "",
  "worked_solution": "Splitting the fraction into separate terms and then simplifying the fractions in the individual terms, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{6a-7b+10}{2} & = \\\\ \\frac{6a}{2}-\\frac{7b}{2}+\\frac{10}{2} & = \\\\ \\frac{6}{2}\\cdot a-\\frac{7b}{2}+\\frac{10}{2} & = \\\\ 3a-\\frac{7b}{2}+5 & .\\end{aligned}\n$$",
  "calculator_instructions": "",
